# packages.x86_64 — hngh live ISO manifest: CachyOS base + Omarchy session.
# Session core mirrors the phase-1 manifest automation/config/omarchy-base.packages
# (clone @ 3faafba2, session-only subset): update the two lists together.
# The avoid-list holds on the ISO: NO linux-omarchy/-headers, limine,
# mkinitcpio UKI hooks, sddm, plymouth. Repo notes: hyprland-guiutils,
# hyprland-preview-share-picker, owe, owe-lockfeed ship from the signed
# [omarchy] repo; the rest from CachyOS/core/extra.

# --- CachyOS base (CachyOS kernel; stock archiso loaders, no boot-chain contact)
base
linux-cachyos
linux-cachyos-headers
linux-firmware
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
mkinitcpio
mkinitcpio-archiso
syslinux
cachyos-keyring
cachyos-mirrorlist
cachyos-v3-mirrorlist
networkmanager
sudo
terminus-font

# --- Omarchy session core (from omarchy-base.packages, session subset)
hyprland
uwsm
quickshell
foot
foot-terminfo
xdg-desktop-portal-hyprland
xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
hyprland-guiutils
hyprland-preview-share-picker
hyprpicker
hyprsunset
grim
slurp
cliphist
wl-clipboard
wtype
brightnessctl
pamixer
pipewire
wireplumber
xdg-terminal-exec
owe
owe-lockfeed
